OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1786970910
OL,3,CTrump scales back military drills with
OL,4,CSouth Korea over Kim Jong Un friendship
OL,6,FDonald Trump has ordered the Pentagon
OL,7,Fto scale back joint military exercises
OL,8,Fwith South Korea, citing his "very
OL,9,Fgood relationship" with North Korean
OL,10,Fleader Kim Jong Un.
OL,12,FThe US president also claimed on
OL,13,Fsocial media South Korea had declined
OL,14,Fto help in the war against Iran.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/10
