PN,30402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1786970910
OL,3,CTrump scales back military drills with
OL,4,CSouth Korea over Kim Jong Un friendship
OL,6,FTrump said the exercises, which began
OL,7,FMonday, were not only costly but "send
OL,8,Fa signal that is totally inappropriate
OL,9,Fand hostile" to North Korea, which he
OL,10,Fsaid had been "unthreatening and
OL,11,Frespectful" during his time in the
OL,12,FWhite House.
OL,14,FTrump wrote on Truth Social:
OL,15,F"Therefore, and based on the fact that
OL,16,Fit is too late to cancel, I have
OL,17,Finstructed Secretary of War, Pete
OL,18,FHegseth, to substantially reduce the
OL,19,FJoint Military Exercises!"
OL,26,@oD@bOUqD@LO]sD@KO]wD@AOU{D@ZO]
