PN,30403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1786970910
OL,3,CTrump scales back military drills with
OL,4,CSouth Korea over Kim Jong Un friendship
OL,6,FHe suggested he recently asked South
OL,7,FKorea's president Lee Jae Myung if
OL,8,Fthey would join the US in the
OL,9,F"denuclearisation" of Iran, stating
OL,10,Fthat they "No thanks!"
OL,12,FIt came as a 60-day deadline for peace
OL,13,Ftalks between the US and Iran, signed
OL,14,Fin June, closed on Monday without any
OL,15,Fconcrete plans announced so far to end
OL,16,Fthe war.
OL,26,@qD@AOUqD@RO]
