PN,30404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1786970910
OL,3,CTrump scales back military drills with
OL,4,CSouth Korea over Kim Jong Un friendship
OL,6,FTrump's move is the latest example of
OL,7,Fthe president appearing to turn
OL,8,Fagainst an ally in favour of a leader
OL,9,Fthat previous administrations have
OL,10,Fcast as an adversary.
OL,12,FHe previously railed against Nato
OL,13,Fallies over a perceived lack of
OL,14,Fsupport for his conflict with Tehran,
OL,15,Fas they seek to confront an
OL,16,Fincreasingly aggressive Russia in the
OL,17,FBaltic region.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/10
