PN,30405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1786970910
OL,3,CTrump scales back military drills with
OL,4,CSouth Korea over Kim Jong Un friendship
OL,6,FThe 11 days of exercises involving
OL,7,F18,000 South Korean soldiers were
OL,8,Fdesigned to beef up readiness against
OL,9,FNorth Korean threats.
OL,11,FThe US military has said the
OL,12,Fsummertime Ulchi Freedom Shield
OL,13,Fexercises reinforce "the role of the
OL,14,Falliance as the linchpin for regional
OL,15,Fpeace and security" and reaffirm "the
OL,16,Fironclad commitment between the United
OL,17,FStates and the Republic of Korea to
OL,18,Fdefend their homelands."
OL,26,@uD@UOUwD@SO]wD@bOUzD@XO]
