OL,3,CTrump scales back military drills with
OL,4,CSouth Korea over Kim Jong Un friendship
OL,6,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,7,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,8,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,9,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,11,FThey are one of the two main combined
OL,12,Fdrills conducted by the countries
OL,13,Fannually, along with their springtime
OL,14,Ftraining.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/10
