PN,30407
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1786970910
OL,3,CTrump scales back military drills with
OL,4,CSouth Korea over Kim Jong Un friendship
OL,6,FUS and South Korean forces were
OL,7,Fexpected to practice joint operations
OL,8,Fin complex scenarios, including a live-
OL,9,Ffire exercise to test joint precision
OL,10,Ftargeting and maneuver, a wet gap
OL,11,Fcrossing, and distribution of
OL,12,Fprepositioned military equipment.
OL,14,FSouth Korea's defense ministry
OL,15,Fconfirmed that the exercises began as
OL,16,Fplanned.
OL,18,FThe joint training started days after
OL,19,FNorth Korea resumed ballistic missile
OL,20,Ftesting activities in defiance of
OL,21,FUnited Nations bans.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
