FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30408
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1786970910
OL,3,CTrump scales back military drills with
OL,4,CSouth Korea over Kim Jong Un friendship
OL,6,FTrump's decision was sharply
OL,7,Fcriticised by Democratic Senator Mark
OL,8,FKelly, a former Navy pilot, who said
OL,9,Fthat "hollowing out these joint
OL,10,Fexercises is shortsighted and a
OL,11,Fmistake".
OL,13,FEarlier this month, South Korea, the
OL,14,FUS and Japan detected the launches of
OL,15,Ftwo ballistic missiles from North
OL,16,FKorea in what were the North's first
OL,17,Fballistic weapons testing activities
OL,18,Fsince late June. The missiles landed
OL,19,Fin the waters off North Korea's east
OL,20,Fcoast.
