PN,30409
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1786970910
OL,3,CTrump scales back military drills with
OL,4,CSouth Korea over Kim Jong Un friendship
OL,6,FTrump met North Korean leader Kim
OL,7,Fthree times during his first term to
OL,8,Fdiscuss the country's nuclear program,
OL,9,Fmost recently in 2019.
OL,11,FSince returning to office, Trump has
OL,12,Fexpressed interest in continuing those
OL,13,Fdiscussions.
OL,15,FIn September last year, Kim said he
OL,16,Fheld "good personal memories" of Trump
OL,17,Fand suggested he could return to talks
OL,18,Fif the US drops "its delusional
OL,19,Fobsession with denuclearisation" of
OL,20,FNorth Korea.
OL,26,@xD@FOUxD@]O]zD@QOU{D@`O]
