OL,3,CTrump scales back military drills with
OL,4,CSouth Korea over Kim Jong Un friendship
OL,6,FTrump's announcement came a day after
OL,7,Fhe posted a photo of himself standing
OL,8,Fnext to Kim, writing that the two
OL,9,Fleaders get along great "despite the
OL,10,Funfriendly look on this particular
OL,11,Fpicture".
